  "details": "I know it's odd to be asking for *fewer* FPS, but it would be nice to have an FPS limiter while the game is not focused or minimized.\nVRC can be pretty intensive for CPU/GPU/VRAM, etc and sometimes I need to tab out to work on other things.  Having an FPS limiter would reduce the resource usage of the client while the game isn't focused.",
